  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK granskning IFFEd</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISK review IFFEd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">-Sida &#xf6;verv&#xe4;ger att st&#xf6;dja the International Finance Facility for Educations (IFFEd) administrativa enhet. IFFEd inr&#xe4;ttades i juli 2023 och den administrativa enheten befinner sig i en uppr&#xe4;ttningsfas. Sida har d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r anlitat en konsult f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra en bed&#xf6;mning av de interna system och kontrollfunktioner som finns p&#xe5; plats, och f&#xf6;r att bed&#xf6;ma planen f&#xf6;r att implementera n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga system och kontroller fram&#xf6;ver, f&#xf6;r att informera Sidas bed&#xf6;mning om en eventuell insats.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Sida is contemplating supporting the administrative unit of the International Finance Facility for Educations (IFFEd). IFFEd was established in July 2023 and the unit is therefore in an implementation phase. Sida has therefore contracted a consultant to perform an assessment of the internal systems and control in place so far, and to assess the plan for implementing necessary systems and controls going forward, in order to inform Sida&#x2019;s appraisal.</narrative>
  </description>
